   "title": "same melody, new lyrics",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Same melody, new lyrics\n\n1. **Load Audio**: pick the recording (press R after adding files to Downloads).\n2. **Transcribe** → score. The **Score Editor** box fills with it; edit there if you like and queue again (transcription is cached). Type `RESET` to reload.\n3. Paste **NEW LYRICS** (one `[Section]` per sung section, in order), set the **song language**, write the **style prompt** without a language tag.\n4. **TRANSPOSE** sliders: `vocal_octave -1` = singer one octave down (same notes); `key_shift` = whole song in another key. Both keep the harmony. Match the style prompt's voice type to the new range.\n5. Queue. mode `full` keeps the transcribed chords.\n\nOptional nodes in the `audio/yue2-same-music-new-lyrics` menu: Describe Track, Strip Chords, Compare Scores."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
